    - target: {fileID: 8299111908199431082, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: JohnWayne
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 592572408}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: isQuestNpc
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: characterName
      value: John Wayne
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: rewardDropPoint
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 870358169}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: requiredItemName
      value: CourtYard
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: rewardItemPrefab
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1615538285643278395, guid: d18d080c63e8e564690ffd147a3b6813, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: completedLines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[0]
      value: This might not be the best time, but I got a job if you want it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[1]
      value: or more like a hit...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[2]
      value: you see theres a prisoner named Cole Maxton that jumped me with a bunch
        of his crones the otherday and stole my key to the Courtyard.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[3]
      value: Maxton hangs out near the courtyard door and is wearing a read flanel.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[4]
      value: I want revenge on that bastard, but I cant get in anymore trouble than
        I already am.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[5]
      value: So thats where you come in and beat the crap out of him for me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[6]
      value: Though I need it to be a little more violent... lets say with a rock
        to the head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: multipleLines.Array.data[7]
      value: You do this for me and I'll tell you where I burried somethin nice in
        the CourtYard along with the shovel I used to bury it.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: completedLines.Array.data[0]
      value: Good work, that oughta teach him not to mess with me
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: completedLines.Array.data[1]
      value: Now here's that shovel, and the location of the treasure is uhhhh...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: completedLines.Array.data[2]
      value: 'I can''t really remeber but I buried it under one of the bushes in the
        courtyard. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8365984140137022275, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
      propertyPath: completedLines.Array.data[3]
      value: Oh, and you can keep that key I managed to get a spare.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 4524c014f7461fa46af879a9f1f57eb1, type: 3}
